### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{password}}"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Protected endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accesstoken}}

### Refresh token (sliding 15-minute expiration)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{accesstoken}}

### Wallet: balance and latest transfers
GET {{host}}/api/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{accesstoken}}

### Transfer (send it again with the same Idempotency-Key: 200, and the money is not moved twice)
POST {{host}}/api/wallet/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{accesstoken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 3f1c2b8e-6a4d-4f1e-9c2a-1b2c3d4e5f60

{
  "recipient": "siti@example.com",
  "amount": 150.25,
  "notes": "Lunch"
}
